    "title_en": "A note on 4-forms in 8-dimensions",
    "abstract_en": "We present a note on two related questions on 4-forms in 8-dimensions. In particular, we clarify that the Cayley form is not unique in determining a metric via the formula of Karigiannis. Additionally, we discuss and prove part of a conjecture of Salamon and Walpuski.",
